1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:04,750
- This is a very old building.
- Sixty years. Used to be a watch factory.

2
00:00:04,916 --> 00:00:07,336
- Uh-oh.
- What?

3
00:00:07,502 --> 00:00:11,552
(Sheldon:)Don't you worry about the residual radium
from the luminous dials?

4
00:00:11,715 --> 00:00:14,305
(Raj:)Not until now.

5
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:18,010
(Sheldon:)I can't believe
I didn't bring my Geiger counter.

6
00:00:18,471 --> 00:00:21,261
Yeah, I had it on my bed,
and I didn't pack it.

7
00:00:21,725 --> 00:00:25,475
(Raj:)- If you're not comfortable staying here...
- I'm kidding. I packed it.

8
00:00:26,354 --> 00:00:30,194
It was a joke. Yeah, I was subverting
the conversational expectations.

9
00:00:30,358 --> 00:00:34,448
(Sheldon:)I believe they call that
the old switcheroo.

10
00:00:35,322 --> 00:00:36,992
(Raj:)Terrific.

11
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:44,250
- Is that woman Aishwarya Rai?
- Yes. Isn't she an amazing actress?

12
00:00:44,414 --> 00:00:47,834
(Sheldon:)Actually, I'd say
she's a poor man's Madhuri Dixit.

13
00:00:48,001 --> 00:00:50,041
How dare you?

14
00:00:50,211 --> 00:00:52,251
(Raj:)Aishwarya Rai is a goddess.

15
00:00:52,422 --> 00:00:57,052
(Raj:)By comparison, Madhuri Dixit
is a leprous prostitute.

16
00:00:58,511 --> 00:01:02,021
(Sheldon:)Sorry, I didn't mean to offend you.

